                  <!-- 
        * NO RESULTS FOUND UI:
        * This block of code checks if the 'listings' array passed from the controller is empty.
        * If it is empty (listings.length === 0), it displays a modern "No Results Found" section.
        * We show an icon, a clear message, and a button to clear the search filters and view all listings.
